<title>USA: Amerac Energy Corp Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Amerac Energy Corp Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three</p>
<p>				     For the Twelve    Months Ended</p>
<p>					Months Ended     (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			    12/31/96   12/31/95  12/31/96  12/31/95</p>
<p> Total revenues	     10,644     4,402     3,170    1,557</p>
<p>(Gain) loss on sale of properties</p>
<p>     and other		  (22)     (850)	 102    (739)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	   1,579	 208     (304)	406</p>
<p>Less preferred dividends and</p>
<p>conversion premium </p>
<p>				 (5,434)     (807)	 ---    (210)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) available to</p>
<p>  common stockholders    (3,855)     (599)     (304)	196</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common share</p>
<p>				  (1.65)    (0.46)    (0.09)     0.14</p>
<p>Weighted avg. common shares and</p>
<p>equivalents outstanding (2)</p>
<p>			    2,331,000 1,306,000 3,324,000 1,372,000</p>
<p>	    ($ in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the $5 million excess of the fair value of the common shares issued to preferred shareholders in the July 1996 conversion over the carrying value of the preferred stock is deducted from net income (loss) to determine net income (loss) applicable to common stockholders for the 1996 full year.</p>
<p>Prior period per share data is restated to reflect the 1 for 15 reverse stock split approved in November 1996.</p>
<p>Net income for the fourth quarter of 1996 includes write offs of $0.1 million for the sale of properties and a gain of $0.8 million from the sale of properties.</p>
